WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.701
♪♪

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:05.200
-We're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.200
Former President Trump defended
his children over the weekend

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.467
against the New York State
Attorney General Letitia James'

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:13.534
lawsuit, and said, quote,
"Ivanka --

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:17.300
Ivanka is a very good person.
Don Jr., he's a good person.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.767
Eric -- Eric --
these are good people."

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:22.968
So, if there's one thing --
one thing he's learned

00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:25.601
from this lawsuit,
it's all of their names.

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.567
According to a new report,
President Biden initially

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:33.400
worried his student debt
forgiveness plan wouldn't

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.400
go over well
with working-class people,

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.968
and told his advisers, quote,

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:38.834
"The federal government
shouldn't be bailing out

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.200
Ivy League graduates."

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.167
I mean, at least not until
they become bank presidents.

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:46.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:50.567
You guys, I got Bernie Sanders
backstage.

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:52.033
I'm going to play to him
a little bit, all right?

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:53.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:56.067
At the Global Citizen music
festival in New York

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:58.067
over the weekend
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:00:58.067 --> 00:00:59.767
appeared to be booed
by the crowd.

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:03.200
To be fair, she completely
flubbed her solo.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:08.167
Florida governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:10.067
has warned of potential
evacuation orders

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:11.968
this week in advance of
Hurricane Ian.

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:14.701
The two aren't related, he just
loves kicking people out.

00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:17.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.534 --> 00:01:20.000
According to a new book
about his business dealings,

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.667
former president Trump once
received a lease payment

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:24.767
in boxes of gold bricks

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:28.067
and asked his security guard,
Matthew Calamari,

00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:30.467
to bring them to his Trump Tower
apartment.

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:32.968
Is it just me or does every
new Trump story sound

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.534
like a 9-year-old wrote
a mafia movie?

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:37.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:38.968
[Mobster accent]
"Forget about it, Calamari.

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:42.000
This town belongs
to Johnny Pizza."

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:47.100
[Normally]
House Republicans on Friday

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.234
announced their new
Congressional platform,

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:51.067
which featured a quote
misattributed

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:52.200
to Abraham Lincoln.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.434
Apparently,
he never actually said

00:01:54.434 --> 00:01:56.534
"Disney+ is grooming
our children."

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:59.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:01.701
Kanye West appeared to comment
on his divorce

00:02:01.701 --> 00:02:04.167
with Kim Kardashian in
an Instagram story yesterday

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:06.634
and said, quote, "London,
I know how you feel.

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:08.367
I lost my Queen too."

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:10.667
It's sweet that he thinks Kim
is a queen,

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:13.367
but weird that he thinks London
is a country.

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:16.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:22.167
"Oh, oh, well aren't you
the Queen of London?"

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:25.000
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.501
In an upcoming book, former
President Trump describes

00:02:27.501 --> 00:02:29.133
"New York Times" reporter
Maggie Haberman

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:31.834
as his psychiatrist,
or that's just what he calls

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:33.667
any lady with glasses.

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:35.934
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:38.601
Former FBI director James Comey,
announced recently

00:02:38.601 --> 00:02:40.868
that he will release
a mystery novel series.

00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:42.200
Let me guess, Hillary did it?

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:48.767
Or she didn't, or she maybe did,
but you're unclear about it?

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:51.367
A teen in Canada recently set
a Guinness world record

00:02:51.367 --> 00:02:54.868
after putting 22 socks
on one foot in 30 seconds,

00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:57.601
all because her father refuses
to let anyone

00:02:57.601 --> 00:02:58.968
touch the thermostat.

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:01.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:04.133
NYU will offer a new course
this fall

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:06.167
focused on singer Lana Del Rey's
music.

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:09.434
To qualify, you must have
completed at least two semesters

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:10.434
of Lexapro.

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:13.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.667 --> 00:03:15.968
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:03:15.968 --> 00:03:18.968
more than half of Americans said
that they have muted themselves

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:21.367
during a virtual meeting
to pass gas.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:24.734
Even worse,
the other half just didn't.

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:27.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.067 --> 00:03:30.200
According to estimates from
the Congressional Budget Office,

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.567
President Biden's plan to
forgive $10,000 per borrower

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:37.200
in Federal Student loan debt
will cost nearly $400 billion.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.701
Or, in student loan terms,
$27 a month

00:03:40.701 --> 00:03:42.367
for 30 billion years.

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:44.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.634 --> 00:03:46.801
According to new data,
coronavirus cases

00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:49.367
are rising in the U.K.,
maybe because last week,

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:52.467
the entire country
attended the same event.

00:03:52.467 --> 00:03:55.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.667
The White House announced
yesterday that President Biden

00:03:57.667 --> 00:03:58.934
will host French President

00:03:58.934 --> 00:04:00.868
Emmanuel Macron
later this year.

00:04:00.868 --> 00:04:03.868
Which is great, but can we say
no gifts this time?

00:04:03.868 --> 00:04:05.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.467 --> 00:04:07.033
[ French accent ] "We noticed
you did not have

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:09.667
a 305-foot woman, and..."

00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:11.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:14.501
"New York famously
has much space, oui?"

00:04:14.501 --> 00:04:16.167
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:21.534
[ Normal voice ] That's -- so,
in 2022,

00:04:21.534 --> 00:04:25.734
one of our monologue writers
were like, "Enough.

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:28.000
I'm going after
the Statue of Liberty."

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.801 --> 00:04:32.267
Republican Congressman
Matt Gaetz announced last week

00:04:32.267 --> 00:04:33.767
that he is starting
his own Twitch

00:04:33.767 --> 00:04:36.934
streaming channel, and tweeted,
"I'm joining Twitch to bring

00:04:36.934 --> 00:04:40.234
my America-first message to a
new generation of voters."

00:04:40.234 --> 00:04:42.367
Previously, the only way
he reached a new generation

00:04:42.367 --> 00:04:44.000
of voters was on Venmo.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:46.234 --> 00:04:50.067
Scientists recently discovered
vaccine-resistant coronavirus

00:04:50.067 --> 00:04:51.234
in Russian bats.

00:04:51.234 --> 00:04:53.501
It's what Putin's calling
Plan B.

00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:56.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.300
"Release the bats."

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.534 --> 00:05:02.567
A panel of doctors recommended
last week that all adults

00:05:02.567 --> 00:05:04.601
under 65-years-old

00:05:04.601 --> 00:05:06.467
should be regularly screened
for anxiety.

00:05:06.467 --> 00:05:08.667
Said adults, "How regularly?
Like, once a year?

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:10.434
Once a month?
Every day?

00:05:10.434 --> 00:05:11.834
Should we screen every day?

00:05:11.834 --> 00:05:13.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:13.567 --> 00:05:16.901
"Rolling Stone" yesterday
published an updated

00:05:16.901 --> 00:05:19.634
list of the 100 greatest
TV shows of all-time.

00:05:19.634 --> 00:05:23.601
And I don't want to brag,
but I read the whole list.

00:05:23.601 --> 00:05:25.834
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.834 --> 00:05:28.300
Not bad, not bad.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.801
100, read 'em all.

00:05:29.801 --> 00:05:31.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.534 --> 00:05:34.267
According to a new survey,
24% of Americans said

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:37.000
that they found it very easy
to make friends as a teenager,

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.834
and the other 76%
are the people they bullied.

00:05:39.834 --> 00:05:42.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.501
A woman in North Dakota
was arrested recently

00:05:44.501 --> 00:05:48.667
after she allegedly brought
a wild raccoon into a bar.

00:05:48.667 --> 00:05:52.033
Said the woman, "Oh, I thought
you said it was rabies night."

00:05:52.033 --> 00:05:54.100
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:56.067 --> 00:05:58.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.901 --> 00:06:01.701
So, the premise of Brian --
I'll say his name --

00:06:01.701 --> 00:06:03.400
the premise of Brian's joke...

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.434
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.434 --> 00:06:08.601
...is that you would hear a bar
was having "ladies night"

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:10.434
and you would hear it
as "rabies night."

00:06:10.434 --> 00:06:13.367
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.367 --> 00:06:15.601
Maybe that's a symptom
that you have rabies.

00:06:15.601 --> 00:06:18.400
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.133
You're home
with your pet raccoon,

00:06:21.133 --> 00:06:23.067
and it bites you, and then,
like, an hour later,

00:06:23.067 --> 00:06:24.367
you're like,
"Did I hear rabies night?"

00:06:24.367 --> 00:06:27.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.534
And finally --
we just let 'em all in, guys.

00:06:30.534 --> 00:06:32.000
We're just finding out with you

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.434
if they're good or not,
you know?

00:06:33.434 --> 00:06:36.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:38.033
And finally, according
to a new survey,

00:06:38.033 --> 00:06:41.033
78% of animal owners said
that seeing their pet

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:42.901
when they come home is the best
part of their day.

00:06:42.901 --> 00:06:45.100
Worst part of their day,
when their spouse

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.234
heard them say that.

00:06:46.234 --> 00:06:47.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:48.567 --> 00:06:50.434
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:06:50.434 --> 00:06:53.634
that his administration
will lower the cost of insulin

00:06:53.634 --> 00:06:56.667
for everyone, regardless
of their Medicare status.

00:06:56.667 --> 00:06:58.767
And not a moment too soon.

00:06:58.767 --> 00:07:00.367
[ Laughter ]

00:07:00.367 --> 00:07:04.934
We didn't make that.
That's an actual product.

00:07:04.934 --> 00:07:07.234
During the same event
at the White House yesterday,

00:07:07.234 --> 00:07:08.834
President Biden
pulled out a copy

00:07:08.834 --> 00:07:12.701
of Florida senator Rick Scott's
12-point plan to rescue America

00:07:12.701 --> 00:07:15.767
and said that it could end
Social Security and Medicare.

00:07:15.767 --> 00:07:18.167
Oh, that'll be popular
in Florida.

00:07:18.167 --> 00:07:19.167
[ Laughter ]

00:07:19.167 --> 00:07:20.667
What's his next idea?

00:07:20.667 --> 00:07:24.434
Abolishing visits
from grandkids?

00:07:24.434 --> 00:07:26.634
According to a new book,
former president Trump

00:07:26.634 --> 00:07:30.300
would tell White House visitors
that he had a secret bathroom.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:34.033
And visitors would tell him,
"Sir, that's just a closet."

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:35.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:39.701 --> 00:07:41.400
[ As Trump ]
That's part of the secret.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:43.300
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.667
[ Normal voice ] The book
also claims that while meeting

00:07:45.667 --> 00:07:48.667
then-president Barack Obama
in 2016 after being elected,

00:07:48.667 --> 00:07:50.601
former president Trump
asked Obama

00:07:50.601 --> 00:07:53.400
how he kept his approval ratings
so high.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.434
"What'd he say," asked Biden.

00:07:55.434 --> 00:07:57.367
[ Laughter ]

00:07:57.367 --> 00:08:00.100
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell said yesterday

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.200
that he will support
the bipartisan bill

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:05.701
to reform the
Electoral Count Act of 1887.

00:08:05.701 --> 00:08:09.033
I guess he still feels bad
after voting no the first time.

00:08:09.033 --> 00:08:10.968
[ Laughter ]

00:08:10.968 --> 00:08:15.467
Britain's Prince George
reportedly told his classmates,

00:08:15.467 --> 00:08:18.334
"My dad will be king,
so you better watch out."

00:08:18.334 --> 00:08:19.501
[ Laughter ]

00:08:19.501 --> 00:08:21.033
Which, you have to admit,

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:24.834
is a crushing comeback
for a 9-year-old.

00:08:24.834 --> 00:08:26.200
"Tag, you're it."

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:29.767
"If by it you mean
the once and future king!"

00:08:33.234 --> 00:08:35.601
New York mayor Eric Adams
announced yesterday

00:08:35.601 --> 00:08:37.467
that he will launch
a chess council

00:08:37.467 --> 00:08:39.701
to develop more
plant-based recipes

00:08:39.701 --> 00:08:41.100
for public school lunches.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.033
Meanwhile, most of
the high school students

00:08:43.033 --> 00:08:45.901
will continue to enjoy
plant-based recess.

00:08:45.901 --> 00:08:47.834
[ Laughter ]

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.434
And finally, after receiving
criticism from viewers,

00:08:52.434 --> 00:08:55.868
Netflix removed the LGBTQ tag
from its new series

00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:57.634
about serial killer
Jeffrey Dahmer.

00:08:57.634 --> 00:09:01.234
On the downside, they left
the food and travel tag.

00:09:01.234 --> 00:09:03.033
[ Laughter ]

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:08.234
President Biden today declared
a major disaster in Florida,

00:09:08.234 --> 00:09:12.968
and then Florida in turn
declared Biden a major disaster.

00:09:12.968 --> 00:09:14.334
[ Laughter ]

00:09:14.334 --> 00:09:17.801
The White House released
a 44-page plan yesterday

00:09:17.801 --> 00:09:18.934
to fight hunger.

00:09:18.934 --> 00:09:21.200
It's just
the Cheesecake Factory menu.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.801
[ Laughter ]

00:09:24.801 --> 00:09:26.868
Before the government runs out
of money tomorrow,

00:09:26.868 --> 00:09:29.834
Congress is reportedly
set to pass stopgap legislation

00:09:29.834 --> 00:09:32.334
to keep the government funded
through 2 1/2 more months.

00:09:32.334 --> 00:09:34.868
Is it just me,
or is the government always

00:09:34.868 --> 00:09:37.734
waiting until the last minute
to fund itself?

00:09:37.734 --> 00:09:40.601
The federal government is like
a kid running for the school bus

00:09:40.601 --> 00:09:43.300
with one pant leg on
holding a waffle.

00:09:44.667 --> 00:09:48.334
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.334 --> 00:09:51.167
Queen Elizabeth's death
certificate was released today

00:09:51.167 --> 00:09:53.000
and said that
she died of old age,

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.000
a condition she battled
for nearly 30 years.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:00.067
[ Laughter ]

00:10:00.067 --> 00:10:02.868
At a recent panel,
Texas Senator Ted Cruz

00:10:02.868 --> 00:10:04.834
was booed by the crowd
after he said that

00:10:04.834 --> 00:10:06.634
the best way
to stop school shootings

00:10:06.634 --> 00:10:08.701
was to increase police presence
on campuses.

00:10:08.701 --> 00:10:10.901
Cruz hadn't been booed that bad

00:10:10.901 --> 00:10:13.200
since the last time
he walked into his house.

00:10:14.467 --> 00:10:15.868
"Hey, family."

00:10:15.868 --> 00:10:18.567
"Boo!"

00:10:18.567 --> 00:10:20.634
Republican operatives
in Pennsylvania

00:10:20.634 --> 00:10:22.801
are reportedly trying to push
the unfounded theory

00:10:22.801 --> 00:10:25.334
that Democratic Senate candidate
and lieutenant governor

00:10:25.334 --> 00:10:27.634
John Fetterman
is affiliated with a gang.

00:10:27.634 --> 00:10:30.634
Even worse, they're trying to
push the unfounded theory

00:10:30.634 --> 00:10:33.467
that Dr. Oz is affiliated
with Pennsylvania.

00:10:33.467 --> 00:10:35.834
[ Laughter ]

00:10:35.834 --> 00:10:38.467
The Netflix reality dating show
"Love Is Blind"

00:10:38.467 --> 00:10:40.601
is reportedly casting
for a new season

00:10:40.601 --> 00:10:42.334
to be set in Washington, D.C.

00:10:42.334 --> 00:10:45.901
Said one contestant,
"Okay, so he's really quiet,

00:10:45.901 --> 00:10:48.267
but an amazing listener."

00:10:48.267 --> 00:10:51.334
[ Laughter ]

00:10:51.334 --> 00:10:53.601
In a new interview,
Tom Hanks said that

00:10:53.601 --> 00:10:56.033
he made a ton of movies,
but added that he thinks

00:10:56.033 --> 00:10:58.033
"four of them are pretty good,"

00:10:58.033 --> 00:11:01.367
and then Vin Diesel said, "I've
also made a ton of movies."

00:11:01.367 --> 00:11:05.534
[ Laughter ]

00:11:06.634 --> 00:11:08.767
Tom Hanks announced
in the same interview

00:11:08.767 --> 00:11:11.033
that next year he will release
his debut novel,

00:11:11.033 --> 00:11:12.234
and no surprise here --

00:11:12.234 --> 00:11:14.968
it's called
"World War II in Space."

00:11:14.968 --> 00:11:17.100
[ Light laughter ]

00:11:19.934 --> 00:11:21.534
Maybe a little surprise here.

00:11:22.968 --> 00:11:25.534
And finally the airline
Virgin Atlantic yesterday

00:11:25.534 --> 00:11:28.334
unveiled its new
gender-neutral uniform policy.

00:11:28.334 --> 00:11:29.901
Flight attendants
can choose to wear

00:11:29.901 --> 00:11:31.334
either pants, a skirt,

00:11:31.334 --> 00:11:33.033
or the Chalamet.

00:11:33.033 --> 00:11:34.200
[ Laughter ]

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:39.133
♪♪

